    "detailed_description": "In &quot;Fruit Salon&quot;, you'll encounter a variety of unique fruits and vegetables, each with its own personality and ailments to cure. From bananas to avocado, no produce problem is too big for you to tackle!<br><br>Using a range of lifelike tools and mechanics, you'll diagnose, treat, and pamper your fruity patients back to health.<br><br>Different tools will be available for you to help the colorful friends!<br><br><strong>GLOW UP THE PATIENT</strong><br>Cut, wash, and make a haircut for the veggies and fruits! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/21c9ebe5bbe1cbedf6d4765f85b4aabe.poster.avif?t=1741698253\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/21c9ebe5bbe1cbedf6d4765f85b4aabe.webm?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/21c9ebe5bbe1cbedf6d4765f85b4aabe.mp4?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>SCAN AND FIND</strong><br>Use the scanner to check what is hidden inside! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/87c1b597b4d2bbe73d96f972e7e324a3.poster.avif?t=1741698253\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/87c1b597b4d2bbe73d96f972e7e324a3.webm?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/87c1b597b4d2bbe73d96f972e7e324a3.mp4?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>TAKE OUT AND ELIMINATE</strong><br>Take out all the stuck objects and make the colorful friend happy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/ee13aa495e136479df2634b7170622fc.poster.avif?t=1741698253\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/ee13aa495e136479df2634b7170622fc.webm?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/ee13aa495e136479df2634b7170622fc.mp4?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CLEAN AND SHINE</strong><br>Clean them, so they can shine bright like a diamond! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/c7236db6e7650861fffe22ee711ef3ad.poster.avif?t=1741698253\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/c7236db6e7650861fffe22ee711ef3ad.webm?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/c7236db6e7650861fffe22ee711ef3ad.mp4?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>DANCE AND ENJOY</strong><br>Don't forget to dance and enjoy your time in <strong>Fruit Salon</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/a4e35aa78c47065d303b0ed2b973a156.poster.avif?t=1741698253\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/a4e35aa78c47065d303b0ed2b973a156.webm?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/a4e35aa78c47065d303b0ed2b973a156.mp4?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But &quot;Fruit Salon&quot; isn't just about fixing fruits and veggies \u2013 it's about immersing yourself in a world of whimsy and wonder. Explore vibrant environments, interact with charming characters, and uncover hidden surprises as you progress through the game.<br><br>So, whether you're a seasoned gamer looking for a fresh new experience or a casual player in search of some fruity fun, &quot;Fruit Salon&quot; has something for everyone. Get ready to dive into a world where healing meets entertainment, and let the adventure begin!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/download__2_.gif?t=1741698253\" width=600 height=280 /></span>",
