d happy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/ee13aa495e136479df2634b7170622fc.poster.avif?t=1741698253\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/ee13aa495e136479df2634b7170622fc.webm?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/ee13aa495e136479df2634b7170622fc.mp4?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CLEAN AND SHINE</strong><br>Clean them, so they can shine bright like a diamond! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/c7236db6e7650861fffe22ee711ef3ad.poster.avif?t=1741698253\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/c7236db6e7650861fffe22ee711ef3ad.webm?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/c7236db6e7650861fffe22ee711ef3ad.mp4?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>DANCE AND ENJOY</strong><br>Don't forget to dance and enjoy your time in <strong>Fruit Salon</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/a4e35aa78c47065d303b0ed2b973a156.poster.avif?t=1741698253\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/a4e35aa78c47065d303b0ed2b973a156.webm?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/a4e35aa78c47065d303b0ed2b973a156.mp4?t=1741698253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But &quot;Fruit Salon&quot; isn't just about fixing fruits and veggies \u2013 it's about immersing yourself in a world of whimsy and wonder. Explore vibrant environments, interact with charming characters, and uncover hidden surprises as you progress through the game.<br><br>So, whether you're a seasoned gamer looking for a fresh new experience or a casual player in search of some fruity fun, &quot;Fruit Salon&quot; has something for everyone. Get ready to dive into a world where healing meets entertainment, and let the adventure begin!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984260/extras/download__2_.gif?t=1741698253\" width=600 height=280 /></span>",
